            {
              "text": "The father agreed to take his son back only if the men paid him two hundred and fifty dollars.",
              "audioStart": 85.625,
              "audioEnd": 90.338
            },
            {
              "text": "The two exhausted men gladly handed over the money just to get rid of the wild boy.",
