        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "The story of these two men shows how bad plans can fail completely.",
              "audioStart": 96.312,
              "audioEnd": 99.95
            },
            {
              "text": "They thought that taking a rich child would be very simple and fast.",
              "audioStart": 100.812,
              "audioEnd": 104.287
            },
            {
              "text": "However, the boy proved to be much more difficult than they had ever imagined.",
              "audioStart": 105.15,
              "audioEnd": 109.125
            },
            {
              "text": "Every single moment spent with him felt like a long year of trouble.",
              "audioStart": 109.987,
              "audioEnd": 113.275
            },
            {
              "text": "The men spent their days running through the trees and trying to avoid his games.",
              "audioStart": 114.138,
              "audioEnd": 118.013
            },
            {
              "text": "They could not sleep because the boy made too much noise around the camp.",
              "audioStart": 118.875,
              "audioEnd": 122.338
