            {
              "text": "Even when they tried to rest, he would jump out from behind a tree.",
              "audioStart": 123.2,
              "audioEnd": 126.575
            },
            {
              "text": "The poor men were tired of the constant stress and the long running.",
              "audioStart": 127.438,
              "audioEnd": 130.775
            },
            {
              "text": "They realized that their plan was a complete disaster from the very beginning.",
              "audioStart": 131.637,
              "audioEnd": 135.463
            },
            {
              "text": "No amount of money seemed worth the pain of staying with Red Chief.",
              "audioStart": 136.325,
              "audioEnd": 139.562
            },
            {
              "text": "They just wanted to return the boy and forget this terrible adventure ever happened.",
              "audioStart": 140.425,
              "audioEnd": 144.463
            },
            {
              "text": "When they finally sent the letter, they hoped for a quick and easy solution.",
              "audioStart": 145.325,
              "audioEnd": 149.1
